# Code owners for the paths that can disable the other gates (MDRS-49, MDRS-54).
#
# ADVISORY: ruleset 20827887 does not set `require_code_owner_review`, so any
# single approval satisfies it. This file only auto-requests reviewers.
#
# The owner is a team so GitHub's code review assignment can rotate a subset.
# That setting lives on the team, not here — round-robin, 2 reviewers, notify
# entire team off. Disable it and GitHub requests all 9 members instead:
# https://github.com/orgs/amel-tech/teams/medaris/settings
#
# GitHub applies the LAST matching rule, so order is specific-after-general.

# Everything else has no owner: reviewer choice stays open for ordinary app and
# library work, which is where most PRs land.

# CI workflows, PR template, dependabot config, and this file itself.
/.github/ @amel-tech/medaris

# The gate scripts CI executes. Weakening one of these is indistinguishable
# from deleting the check it backs.
/tools/ci/ @amel-tech/medaris
